      "created_at": "2026-01-29T09:41:38.370Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/support-at-erpgulf\">@Support-at-ERPgulf</a>  team has contributed this app for enabling e-invocing for UAE</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox githubrepo\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/ERPGulf/uae_erpgulf\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/ERPGulf/uae_erpgulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">github.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"github-row\" data-github-private-repo=\"false\">\n  <img width=\"690\" height=\"344\" src=\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/44b16a2703a1b32cb22fbf19ad4b235a/ERPGulf/uae_erpgulf\" class=\"thumbnail\">\n\n  <h3><a href=\"https://github.com/ERPGulf/uae_erpgulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub - ERPGulf/uae_erpgulf: E-Invoicing for UAE , for EPRNext , by ERPGulf</a></h3>\n\n    <p><span class=\"github-repo-description\">E-Invoicing for UAE , for EPRNext , by ERPGulf</span></p>\n</div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>As posted above, Peppol integration has been done for Belgium, which is scalable for other European countries as well. This ensure compatibility of platform with ERPNext. ERPGulf team shared their plan on Peppol in readme.</p>\n<p>Cc: <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/husna\">@Husna</a></p>",
